a timer called clock.
Start the clock.
Wait -1 seconds.
Sleep for -2 seconds.
Stop the clock.
If the clock's duration in milliseconds is less than 500 then, print "negative second waits returned at once".
Otherwise, print "negative second waits took {the clock's duration in milliseconds} milliseconds".
